--!strict

-- Plain data only (no Roblox types) so the Lune tests can require this file.
-- Kind: Source releases stored items, Processor runs a recipe, Sink sells items,
-- Storage buffers one straw type, Terminal has no ports and runs truck trips.
-- ExhaustOffset is the steam stack top on the imported model, from the base center in studs.
-- UnlockAfterFirstSale follows spec 12.2: storage and trucks unlock after the first pellet sale.
-- Farm machines (Kind Farm) stand beside a paddy instead of on the factory floor. PlaceNear names
-- the site, PaddyReach is the widest gap allowed between the machine and the paddy edge, and
-- FarmAction is what the machine does to that paddy's rows every WorkSeconds: Plant (paying the
-- usual seed cost) or Harvest (earning the usual grain). Balance assumptions, tune in playtests.
-- Week 6: Research names the ResearchDefinitions project that unlocks a machine. MaxPerPlayer caps
-- how many one player may own. A Sink with Prices buys every listed item at its own price, and
-- InputOnly gives a placed machine an IN port but no OUT port. ExhaustPart names the part of the
-- imported model that steam or flare rises from, when there is no fixed ExhaustOffset.
-- Ports (docs/MachinePorts.md): a machine with ports has a primary IN on its West side and OUT on
-- its East side, built from InputItem, OutputItem, InputPerCycle and so on. ExtraPorts lists more:
-- Name, Direction (In or Out), Medium (Item, Fluid, Gas), Item, PerCycle, Capacity, Side and
-- Offset (studs along that side, in the unturned frame). Vent lets an unconnected Out port release
-- its units into the air instead of blocking the machine.
-- Power (docs/IndustryExpansion.md 2.2): PowerKW is what a machine draws while it works. Kind
-- Generator makes PowerOutputKW: Fuel "Sun" (always, dimmed by smog), "Crank" (while a player has
-- cranked it, up to MaxCrankSeconds), "Diesel" (charges OperatingCostPerCycle every cycle) or a
-- fuel item through its IN port (InputItem, one cycle per unit). SmogPerCycle adds to the district
-- smog each cycle it burns. Kind Battery stores CapacityKJ and moves up to RateKW. Kind Pole only
-- carries power. Reach (studs) is how far a pole, generator or battery connects (Shared/PowerGrid).
-- Fluids (section 2.3): InputMedium and OutputMedium set the primary ports' medium (Fluid or Gas,
-- piped instead of belted). NoInput makes an extractor with no IN port, such as the water pump.
